   "updated": 1762700000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Scale and limits",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Scale and limits",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "text-72",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 1138,
   "width": 1035.6000000000001,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1506442652,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 664876774,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1762700000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Guarantees: no lost runs (lease), no duplicate effects (idempotency keys + fencing), resumable runs (checkpoint log).\nHonest limit: effects on outside systems are only as safe as their support for idempotency keys.\nScale out: add API and worker processes freely. The bottleneck is Postgres write throughput.\nAt 10x: PgBouncer, batch claims, partial indexes on queued jobs, read replica for status reads.\nAt 100x: partition or shard by tenant, or move the queue to Kafka/SQS and keep Postgres for run state.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Guarantees: no lost runs (lease), no duplicate effects (idempotency keys + fencing), resumable runs (checkpoint log).\nHonest limit: effects on outside systems are only as safe as their support for idempotency keys.\nScale out: add API and worker processes freely. The bottleneck is Postgres write throughput.\nAt 10x: PgBouncer, batch claims, partial indexes on queued jobs, read replica for status reads.\nAt 100x: partition or shard by tenant, or move the queue to Kafka/SQS and keep Postgres for run state.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
